   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04I:64",
   "ptr": "0x64",
   "len": 12,
   "jp": "  たなァ。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 12,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04I:3b"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04I:73",
   "ptr": "0x73",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　・・・まあ、ゆっくり休んでください\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "  たなァ。\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04I:3b"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04I:9c",
   "ptr": "0x9c",
   "len": 6,
   "jp": "  よ」",
   "en": "please, rest up and take your time.\"",
   "max": 6,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04I:c0",
   "ptr": "0xc0",
   "len": 6,
   "jp": "学者\\n",
   "en": "Scholar",
   "max": 6,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04I:c9",
   "ptr": "0xc9",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "「リールの病気は直ったんですか？\\n",
   "en": "\"Riel's illness is cured? Why, that's wonderful!",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "学者\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04I:ee",
   "ptr": "0xee",
   "len": 20,
   "jp": "　それはよかった！\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 20,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04I:c9"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04I:106",
   "ptr": "0x106",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "　え？　ずいぶん前に直ってた？\\n",
   "en": "What? She got better long ago? ...I-I see.",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04I:129",
   "ptr": "0x129",
   "len": 30,
   "jp": "　・・・そ、そうなんですか。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 30,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04I:106"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04I:14b",
   "ptr": "0x14b",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　私、ここに足留めされてるせいで、\\n",
   "en": "I've been stuck here, so I don't know a thing. No news gets through, you see...\"",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04I:172",
   "ptr": "0x172",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "  何も知らないんです。なにしろ、\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04I:14b"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04I:197",
   "ptr": "0x197",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "  情報が入ってこなくて・・・」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04I:14b"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04I:1bd",
   "ptr": "0x1bd",
   "len": 6,
   "jp": "学者\\n",
   "en": "Scholar",
   "max": 6,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04I:1c6",
   "ptr": "0x1c6",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「いったい、外では何が起こってるんで\\n",
   "en": "\"What in the world is going on outside?\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "学者\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04I:1ef",
   "ptr": "0x1ef",
   "len": 12,
   "jp": "  すか？」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 12,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04I:1c6"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04I:204",
   "ptr": "0x204",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「こう、街中が物騒だと、めったに客も\\n",
   "en": "\"With the whole town this dangerous, hardly a customer comes by. ...So, what'll you have?\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04I:22d",
   "ptr": "0x22d",
   "len": 18,
   "jp": "  来やしないよ。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 18,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04I:204"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04I:242",
   "ptr": "0x242",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "　・・・で、何が欲しいんだい？」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "  来やしないよ。\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04I:204"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04I:26d",
   "ptr": "0x26d",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "「私は行商をして歩いてる者なんですが、\\n",
   "en": "\"I'm a traveling peddler, see, but even if I wanted to go stock up on goods, the way things are...",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04I:298",
   "ptr": "0x298",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  商品を仕入れに行こうにも、この有り\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04I:26d"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04I:2c1",
   "ptr": "0x2c1",
   "len": 16,
   "jp": "  様では・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 16,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04I:26d"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04I:2d5",
   "ptr": "0x2d5",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "　早いとこ、なんとかなってくれないと、\\n",
   "en": "If something isn't done about this soon, I'll be left high and dry.\"",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04I:300",
   "ptr": "0x300",
   "len": 30,
   "jp": "  日干しになっちまいますよ」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 30,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04I:2d5"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04I:327",
   "ptr": "0x327",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「困ったわねェ、買い出しにも行けやし\\n",
   "en": "\"What a pickle. I can't even go out for supplies.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04I:350",
   "ptr": "0x350",
   "len": 12,
   "jp": "  ないよ」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 12,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04I:327"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04I:36a",
   "ptr": "0x36a",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「兵士たちの指揮系統について、教えて\\n",
