   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04I:411",
   "ptr": "0x411",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  《貴族の屋敷》だが、そこにいる兵士\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04I:3e8"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04I:43a",
   "ptr": "0x43a",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  たちはダンカンという貴族が統括して\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04I:3e8"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04I:463",
   "ptr": "0x463",
   "len": 10,
   "jp": "  いる。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 10,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04I:3e8"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04I:471",
   "ptr": "0x471",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  ダンカンは《貴族の屋敷》の主だよ。\\f",
   "en": "Duncan's the master of the Nobles' Mansion.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04I:49b",
   "ptr": "0x49b",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　次に、《関所》の兵士たちだが、奴ら\\n",
   "en": "Next, the soldiers at the Checkpoint. They're led by a noble named Glauben. He owns the big mansion next to the Mayor's house.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04I:4c4",
   "ptr": "0x4c4",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  を束ねてるのはグラウベンという貴族\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04I:49b"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04I:4ed",
   "ptr": "0x4ed",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  だ。市長の家の隣にある大きな屋敷の\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04I:49b"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04I:516",
