   "len": 10,
   "jp": "  主さ。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 10,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04I:49b"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04I:524",
   "ptr": "0x524",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　《バルクルーサ》市街の兵士を束ねる\\n",
   "en": "Genhas commands the soldiers in the streets of Balkrutha. The soldiers of Balkrutha Castle answer to Administrator Malder.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04I:54d",
   "ptr": "0x54d",
   "len": 18,
   "jp": "  のがゲンハス。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 18,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04I:524"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04I:562",
   "ptr": "0x562",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　《バルクルーサ城》の兵士たちは司政\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "  のがゲンハス。\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04I:524"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04I:58b",
