   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04I:619",
   "ptr": "0x619",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  張り争いとかで兵士たちの横の繋がり\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04I:5f0"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04I:642",
   "ptr": "0x642",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  は、それほど緊密じゃないんだよね。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04I:5f0"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04I:66b",
   "ptr": "0x66b",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  命令も別々に出てるみたいだし・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04I:5f0"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04I:695",
   "ptr": "0x695",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　戒厳令を出したのは領主様だけど、そ\\n",
   "en": "It was the lord who declared martial law, but after that, only Genhas's and Glauben's soldiers moved to seal off the city and the Checkpoint.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04I:6be",
   "ptr": "0x6be",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  の後、街や関所の封鎖に動いたのはゲ\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04I:695"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04I:6e7",
   "ptr": "0x6e7",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  ンハスとグラウベンの兵士だけだよ。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04I:695"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04I:711",
   "ptr": "0x711",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　マルダーの兵士たちは城から一歩も出\\n",
   "en": "Malder's soldiers haven't set one foot outside the castle.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04I:73a",
   "ptr": "0x73a",
   "len": 18,
   "jp": "  て来ないんだ。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 18,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04I:711"
  },
