   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　そういえば、遺跡調査反対派や魔法使\\n",
   "en": "Come to think of it, it was the castle soldiers who arrested the ruins-survey opponents and the magic-users... Malder's men.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04I:779",
